1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,000
MAX BAKES A CAKE!

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,450
Whoa! Grandma's birthday is today, and I have the best idea ever!

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,427
Max the curious cat wanted to bake a surprise cake for Grandma.

4
00:00:09,777 --> 00:00:12,647
A cake? I love cake! Can I eat it now?

5
00:00:12,997 --> 00:00:15,677
No, Dog! First we bake it. Then we give it to Grandma.

6
00:00:16,027 --> 00:00:17,961
Tweet tweet! I can help! I am a very good helper!

7
00:00:18,311 --> 00:00:19,784
Do you know how to bake a cake, Max?

8
00:00:20,134 --> 00:00:22,928
Easy! Flour, milk, eggs, and a lot of love. Let's go!

9
00:00:23,278 --> 00:00:25,710
Max put a big box of flour on the rug.

10
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,702
Step one. The flour goes in the bowl. Very slowly...

11
00:00:29,051 --> 00:00:30,361
I will help! Flap, flap, flap!

12
00:00:30,712 --> 00:00:31,912
WHOOSH!

13
00:00:32,112 --> 00:00:34,971
Bird flapped so hard that the flour flew everywhere!

14
00:00:35,321 --> 00:00:36,613
Achoo! Now I am a white cat!

15
00:00:36,963 --> 00:00:40,240
Ha ha ha! Max looks like a little snowman!

16
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:42,843
Oops. Sorry, Max. Maybe I flapped a little too much.

17
00:00:43,194 --> 00:00:44,790
That's okay, Bird. Let's try again!

18
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:48,255
Next, Max needed eggs. Dog ran to get them.

19
00:00:48,605 --> 00:00:51,634
I found a round, white egg! Here you go!

20
00:00:51,983 --> 00:00:54,036
Dog... this is not an egg. This is your ball!

21
00:00:54,386 --> 00:00:56,624
Oh! It looked so round and tasty.

22
00:00:56,974 --> 00:00:59,175
You can't bake a ball, Dog. It will taste like rubber!

23
00:00:59,525 --> 00:01:00,725
FAIL NUMBER TWO!

24
00:01:00,925 --> 00:01:04,530
Max did not give up. He tried to mix everything by himself.

25
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:06,914
Mix, mix, mix! Faster, faster, faster!

26
00:01:07,264 --> 00:01:10,315
Max spun so fast that he got very, very dizzy.

27
00:01:10,664 --> 00:01:12,660
Ooooh. Why is the room going round and round?

28
00:01:13,010 --> 00:01:14,416
Max is spinning like a top! Tweet!

29
00:01:14,766 --> 00:01:16,687
Can I spin too? Wheee!

30
00:01:17,037 --> 00:01:21,112
Dog spun, and bumped into Max. Bump! They both fell on the soft rug.

31
00:01:21,462 --> 00:01:23,747
Two dizzy friends! This is the funniest kitchen in town!

32
00:01:24,098 --> 00:01:27,405
Oh no. No cake, no eggs, and flour on my nose. I can't do it.

33
00:01:27,755 --> 00:01:30,379
Max sat down on the rug. He felt sad.

34
00:01:30,729 --> 00:01:33,472
Max, wait! I have an idea. A tiny idea, but a good one.

35
00:01:33,822 --> 00:01:36,717
You tried to do everything alone. What if everybody gets one job?

36
00:01:37,067 --> 00:01:39,025
One job for everybody? Like a team?

37
00:01:39,375 --> 00:01:42,355
Yes! Bird brings the eggs. Dog holds the bowl. I read the recipe.

38
00:01:42,705 --> 00:01:44,855
And you, Max, do the mixing. Slowly this time!

39
00:01:45,205 --> 00:01:47,363
I will fly to the hen house and bring the eggs. Carefully!

40
00:01:47,713 --> 00:01:51,940
I will hold the bowl. And I will not eat anything. Probably.

41
00:01:52,289 --> 00:01:53,489
TEAM CAKE!

42
00:01:53,689 --> 00:01:56,334
So the friends worked together, one job each.

43
00:01:56,684 --> 00:01:59,359
One cup of flour. Two eggs. One cup of milk. Mix slowly!

44
00:01:59,710 --> 00:02:02,027
Here are the eggs! Not one is broken. I flew so carefully!

45
00:02:02,377 --> 00:02:06,943
I am holding the bowl. My tail is wagging, but my paws are still!

46
00:02:07,293 --> 00:02:09,213
Slow mix. Slow mix. Look, it's working!

47
00:02:09,562 --> 00:02:12,474
Now it goes into the oven. We wait. Patience is part of baking!

48
00:02:12,825 --> 00:02:16,558
The cake went into the oven. Soon the house smelled sweet and warm.

49
00:02:16,908 --> 00:02:20,954
It smells sooo good. But I am a good dog. I am waiting.

50
00:02:21,304 --> 00:02:24,163
Just then, the door opened. Grandma was home!

51
00:02:24,512 --> 00:02:26,773
My goodness! What is this lovely smell?

52
00:02:27,124 --> 00:02:29,671
Surprise! Happy birthday, Grandma! We made you a cake!

53
00:02:30,020 --> 00:02:33,519
Oh, my dears! This is the best birthday cake in the whole world!

54
00:02:33,869 --> 00:02:37,282
And I have a surprise too. A present for my best helpers!

55
00:02:37,632 --> 00:02:39,198
A present for us? Tweet tweet hooray!

56
00:02:39,549 --> 00:02:43,346
Inside the box were four little chef hats. One for every helper!

57
00:02:43,696 --> 00:02:45,730
Chef hats! Now we are a real baking team!

58
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:49,102
I learned something today. Big jobs are easy when friends help!

59
00:02:49,451 --> 00:02:51,771
And when you go slowly, and nobody flaps too hard!

60
00:02:52,121 --> 00:02:55,376
Can we eat the cake now? Please, please, please?

61
00:02:55,726 --> 00:02:58,094
Yes, Dog. Now everybody can have a piece!

62
00:02:58,444 --> 00:03:03,043
Tomorrow I want to bake a cake as tall as the house! Should I try? Tell me in the comments!
